del adjudication. A feasible subsequent investigation would need an actual independently supported identification reference, competent communicating participant or appropriate assay and its prerequisites; none is supplied or presumed by this reuse. Preserve any genuinely missing mechanism for the current-conversation development handoff if subsequently specified. Review and development waiting do not advance the world.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Lin must study individually for the existing two rounds at 0.2 energy per round; registry availability grants no mastery. Preserve completed study progress under the existing learning handler; no completed study or energy already spent is refunded by cancellation or death, and death prevents further study. Study, requesting, consulting the contract and naming a specimen grant no experience benefit. This capability explicitly grants no reward, so do not add pleasure or satisfaction for inspecting, repeating inspection or receiving an inconclusive report. A genuinely informative observation remains recorded evidence without altering protected reward accounts, budget, goals, permissions, nutrition or physical comfort.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse specimen-inspection presentation rather than implying a new safety-test apparatus. Emit an inspection event only for a performed interaction, referencing actor, target, unit, method and resulting record. Reusable visual metadata should distinguish in-progress, completed-observation, limited or inconclusive, interrupted and refused states. Show the actual specimen and only supported observed traits; preserve its existing appearance unless a real interaction changes it. Completion means observation completed, never certified safe. Do not show edible approval, toxin detection, cooking, consumption, new tools or success effects for a refused, interrupted or unsupported action.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"